    <string name="ray_mouse_intro_title">Motion Mouse tips</string>
    <string name="ray_mouse_intro_aim">Move the cursor: calibration makes the current phone plane neutral. Turn left or right within that plane for horizontal movement; tilt forward or back for vertical movement.</string>
    <string name="ray_mouse_intro_touch">Touch gestures: a tap clicks at the cursor; a swipe maps 1:1 from there without moving the cursor. Two fingers scroll.</string>
    <string name="ray_mouse_intro_calibrate">Quick calibration: hold the phone in a comfortable neutral position and hold Volume Down.</string>
    <string name="ray_mouse_intro_dim">Auto-dim: activate the control area and it dims after 10 seconds. Tap outside or leave this screen to restore.</string>
    <string name="ray_mouse_intro_back">Back: while the control area is active, the system Back gesture is forwarded to the external app.</string>
